@startuml WF-01_Admin_Configuration
title WF-01: Admin Configuration (Feature F-01 | Scenarios DS-01, DS-02)\nProject: Intelligent Hotel Concierge Robot (HC-Robot) - FA26SE905 | Baseline: review-2

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #D97706
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 13
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #64748B

|Hotel Admin|
start
:Access Management Portal and submit login credentials;

|Backend|
:Verify account credentials and role permissions;

if (Credentials valid and account active?) then (No - Authentication failed)
  :Reject login attempt and return authentication error;
  |Hotel Admin|
  :View authentication error message;
  stop
else (Yes - Authenticated)
  |Backend|
  :Issue JWT access token and record LOGIN audit log;
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    AdminSession = **AUTHENTICATED**
    (AuditLog.action = "LOGIN")
  end note
endif

|Hotel Admin|
:Open configuration workspace and submit updates\n(Knowledge .md files, FAQs/Scenarios, Promotions/Ads, or Robot Expressions);

|Backend|
:Validate file extension (.md), structure, and configuration schema;

if (Submitted document and configuration valid?) then (No - DS-02: Unsupported or corrupted document)
  :Reject invalid submission without modifying active data;
  note right
    **Exception Scenario DS-02**
    Existing valid KnowledgeBase remains **PUBLISHED**.
    Corrupted or unsupported file (e.g., non-.md) is discarded.
  end note
  :Return validation error details to Management Portal;

  |Hotel Admin|
  :Review validation error alert and retain current active configuration;
  stop

else (Yes - DS-01: Valid configuration update)
  |Backend|
  :Save updated records and stage knowledge content for publication;
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    KnowledgeBase.status = **DRAFT**
    (Saved to Obsidian Vault / PostgreSQL tables)
  end note

  |Hotel Admin|
  :Review staged changes and initiate "Synchronize to Robot";

  |Backend|
  fork
    :Chunk Markdown files, generate embeddings,\nand synchronize ChromaDB vector store;
  fork again
    :Reload in-memory AI dialogue scenario cache\nand publish active promotions & expressions;
  end fork
  :Mark configuration package as published and dispatch sync payload;
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    KnowledgeBase.status: **DRAFT -> PUBLISHED**
    (AuditLog recorded for configuration sync)
  end note

  |Robot|
  :Receive synchronized configuration and activate updated\nKnowledge Base, FAQs, promotions, and expressions;
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    Robot configuration = **SYNCED**
  end note
  :Report synchronization completion status to Backend;

  |Backend|
  :Update synchronization status and notify Management Portal;

  |Hotel Admin|
  :Verify live deployment on portal and robot kiosk interface;
  stop
endif

@enduml

